%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't have the right to fall in love again.\d%K%P
「我…已经没有资格开始一段新恋情了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDamn right you don't.\d%K%P
「才没有呢」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHey, princess...\d%K%P
「等等，公主…」%K%P
Himeo seconded my opinion with fierce emphasis.%K%P
姫绪小姐对我的话，给予了很强的“肯定”…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dIt's true that I'm worried about you.\nAnd I want you back to your usual self as soon as\npossible.\d%K%P
「我对你的担心并不是虚情假意。\n从心底希望着，你尽快能回到以前的样子」%K%P
In her eyes, I could see worry, trust, and tenderness...%K%P
她凝视着我的眼神里，有担心，有信赖，有慈爱…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dBut I can't accept that choice. Why does it have to be\nToko, of all people...?\d%K%P
「但是，那个选择我不能认同。\n为什么偏偏是小都子啊…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪、小姐…」%K%P
...mixed with disgust, weariness, and hate.%K%P
然而，嫌恶，怀疑，与憎恨也深陷其中。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫希
\dIs that how you've been viewing her from the start?\nWas the whole thing about being her guardian all a lie?\d%K%P
「你，一直是用那种眼光来看那女孩的吗？\n做她的监护人，想要守护她什么的，果然都是骗人的吗！？」%K%P
She used to be my comrade in arms.%K%P
我们过去，是同志。%K%P
We both wished to help Toko get into Shuusen Preparatory.\nTo alleviate her economic burden.\nWe both wanted her to be happy.%K%P
为了让美都子，能够顺利进入秋泉大附。\n为了减轻她的经济负担。\n为了让她…幸福地生活下去。%K%P
Our goals had always been the same -- we might have fought\na lot, but beyond that, we felt an iron bond linking us.%K%P
我们的目的，一直是共同一致的。\n在无尽的吵嘴中，渐渐地感到了深厚的感情羁绊。%K%P
...Until the end of last year, anyway.%K%P
…直到，去年。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou traitor! You should be arrested for public indecency!\nF-For smoking in public or something!\d%K%P
「你这个叛徒！\n应该以违反条例之罪被抓起来！\n或、或者走路吸烟什么的！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSnap out of it, princess.\nOsamu hasn't fallen -that- low yet.\d%K%P
「算了吧公主…\n理君，可没有“那么”坏啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dB-But... but...\d%K%P
「可、可是…可是」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI mean, I'd say Ms. Landlord is more at fault here.\nFor being the first to fall for him, and then making it\nknown to everyone.\d%K%P
「硬要说的话…起因是出自房东小姐吧？\n喜欢上了也好，坦白了心意也好」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI-I don't believe that, okay?!\d%K%P
「我、我才不信呢！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDespite how transparent she's being?\d%K%P
「房东小姐都认真到这种程度了，你也不信？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI'm sure she's just confused!\nShe was deceived by that evil man! She'll snap out of it,\nI'm sure!\d%K%P
「那只是她一时糊涂！\n受了某人的欺骗而已！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDeceived or not, it's pretty obvious she's genuinely in\nlove with Osamu.\d%K%P
「就算是被骗了…\n那也是，真真正正地爱上了理君啊？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「哎…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI mean, she's not even hiding it anymore.\nShe's more obvious than me, and more forceful than you.\d%K%P
「她已经，谁都不瞒了哦？\n比我还要直白，比公主更还要强硬哦？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dLaughing, crying, getting hurt...\nToko's in so much pain. I can hardly bear looking at her.\d%K%P
「欢笑，哭泣，才下眉头，却上心头…\n我不想看到如今的小都子，深陷于如此的苦恼之中…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo you do get it, after all...\d%K%P
「你这不是很明白么…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI mean, she only cares about him! Now, I know I don't\nhave the keenest eye when it comes to stuff like this, but\neven I can tell!\d%K%P
「因为小都子，她的心里只有理先生啊！\n就算我再有眼无珠，这一点还是看得清清楚楚！」%K%P
Toko... confessed to me, proving with deeds that her words\nwere not empty. Her entire being burned with love for me.%K%P
都子她…\n向我告白了，采取了如同那句话所述的那般态度。\n她对我的爱意，一览无余。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dListen, Osamu. Ms. Landlord passed her exams.\nShe got her scholarship with Shuusen, just like you\nwanted.\d%K%P
「呐，理君。\n房东小姐，她考上了哦？秋泉大附属的免费生」%K%P
She was waiting for my reply, refusing to back down or\nmove forward until she got her answer. But it all ended up\nbeing postponed due to my own selfishness.%K%P
进也不得，退也不得，她等待着这样的我去回应…\n然而，我一直单方面选择了无尽的拖延…%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dShe gave it her all because she knew you'd be happy for\nher if she succeeded. And she got the results she wanted.\d%K%P
「她为了不辜负理君，拼命地努力了，\n结果目标实现了啊？」%K%P
I wasn't sure how Toko felt as she waited for my answer.%K%P
都子怀着何种心情来等待我的回应，\n我仍然不是很清楚。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIn the end, her goal and her methods seemed to have\nswitched places, but still... she overcame all the\nobstacles thrown in her way.\d%K%P
「最后，虽然目的取代了手段，\n但也是精彩地突破了一道人生难关哦？」%K%P
But I knew that had I gone home during the past two weeks,\nshe would have still made dinner for me, prioritizing my\nmood and circumstances over her own.%K%P
可是，我已经两周没有回家了，\n她却什么都没有说，若无其事地生火做饭，\n对我的状况，也仿佛一无所知一般…%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo, Osamu... the least you can do is give her an answer.\d%K%P
「所以，理君…\n你可要好好地回应人家啊？」%K%P
Until I decided to bring it up from my end, Toko would not\ntalk about the issue. She wouldn't even broach the\nsubject.%K%P
她明明，什么都没有说，\n什么都没有索求。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIf you keep delaying this because of what happened with\nyour wife, Ms. Landlord won't be able to take it for much\nlonger.\d%K%P
「以夫人的事为借口，总是犹豫不决…\n一直这么拖延下去的话，那个姑娘，可真要累感不爱了啊？」%K%P
Yet she was unable to give up.\nHer love -- for whatever reason -- would not be\nextinguished.%K%P
但是，她却没有放弃，\n也没有讨厌我。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dTo be honest, I'm against it. And I'm not even talking\nabout the princess. I don't think there's anyone here who\nbelieves her feelings are right.\d%K%P
「说实话，我非常反对，公主她是非常非常反对，\n支持房东小妹发展这份感情的人，根本不存在」%K%P
Regardless of who looked at this issue, they'd all brand\nit a mistake. It was a terrible, foolish choice to make.%K%P
不管是谁看，都是错误的，\n不管是谁看，都是愚蠢的选择。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThey're wrong, but that's precisely what makes her\nfeelings so strong.\d%K%P
「虽然是错误的…\n但也正因为如此，才说明她的心意是如此坚定的啊」%K%P
I could hardly believe it myself, but she seemed dead\nserious.%K%P
对我来说，虽然有些难以置信…\n但无论如何，都是真情实感。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy...?\d%K%P
「什么…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dA-Ah?! The bottle...\d%K%P
「啊、啊～！？\n瓶子…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dEh? W-Wait. I only opened this thirty-year-old baby\ntoday!\nI only had time to drink half of it...\d%K%P
「诶？不、不会吧。\n今日刚刚开封，３０年的洋酒…\n我明明只喝了一半…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...Isn't that quite enough?\d%K%P
「…你喝得这也不少了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy does it have to be this way?\d%K%P
「为什么，会变成了这样啊…」%K%P
The five glasses of scotch I gulped down in quick\nsuccession felt like they'd completely lit my brain on\nfire.%K%P
５杯不加水威士忌，连着喝下去，\n刺激着我的脑海，一片焦灼。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy do you keep blaming Toko?!\nWhat has she done to you?!\d%K%P
「为什么你们都要责怪都子啊…\n那孩子做错了什么吗…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d?! O-Osamu...\d%K%P
「啊！？\n理、理先生…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dLeave... leave her alone!\nI won't allow you to bully her any longer!\d%K%P
「不要…不要欺负都子！\n我的都子，你们不许再说她的坏话了！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
I couldn't take it anymore.%K%P
我终于爆发了。%K%P
I couldn't accept the very idea that Toko had to suffer.%K%P
都子感到痛苦，都子感到悲伤，\n那种事我无法容许。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wanted to make her the happiest girl in the world.\d%K%P
「我想让她，\n成为这个世界上，最幸福的女孩…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wanted her to concentrate on what she liked, and learn\nabout the world around her. As for love... I hoped she'd\ntake her time with it and make sure not to rush things.\d%K%P
「对喜欢的东西拼命追求，\n按部就班地升学，成长，\n恋情也…慢慢地，不紧不慢地，循序渐进…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wanted her to lead a normal and fun life with everyone\nelse.\d%K%P
「我希望她过上普通而平淡\n和大家一起的欢乐学园生活」%K%P
When I first met her, all she would ever show me was an\nangry expression.%K%P
相遇那时，她总是对我怒目而视。%K%P
She slapped and lectured me, but at the same time, she\nalso looked out for me.%K%P
对我训斥，对我说教，但是，一直对我照顾有加。%K%P
Her kindness brought me to tears, and I did indeed cry in\nfront of her on several occasions.%K%P
我简直要喜极而泣了，\n实际上，不知道哭了多少次。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIf she wanted to continue her studies, I'd find a way to\nafford her university fees. If she wanted to work, I'd do\neverything in my power to find her a good place.\d%K%P
「只要都子希望，我就要让她上大学。\n如果她说要就职，我也要尽可能地竭尽全力帮她」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd once she grew up and found a person she loved... I\nwould have liked to cheer her on.\d%K%P
「成人以后，如果她真心喜欢上了一个人的话…\n我会努力地，拼命地，给予她祝福」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI would have loved to organize a blissful wedding\nceremony that left no room for complaints.\d%K%P
「谁也不会在身后指指点点，\n举行一场…洋溢着幸福的婚礼」%K%P
As time passed, she began to smile at me more.%K%P
变得亲密无间，渐渐地，她对我露出了笑容。%K%P
Whenever we returned from work or went out shopping. Every\ntime we studied together, and each time we had dinner.%K%P
一起回家，一起购物，一起学习，一起吃晚饭…%K%P
Both her touch and cooking filled me with warmth.%K%P
她的手，温暖无比…\n她做的饭菜，也是温暖人心…%K%P
Back in those day, I was happy enough to be constantly on\nthe verge of tears, and I wanted to return her smile with\none of my own.%K%P
她对着喜极而泣的我，\n用无尽的笑颜来回应。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut then... why... why did it have to be me...?\d%K%P
「明明是…明明是这样…啊，\n为什么，那个人会是我啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy did you have to be in such a hurry, Toko...?\nYour future was bright and brimming with possibilities!\d%K%P
「为什么要那么迫不及待啊，都子…\n你的将来，是那么地光芒闪耀，像璀璨的星星一样！」%K%P
As even more time passed, Toko's smile started losing its\nvigor.%K%P
时光流转，她的笑颜，渐渐地失去了力气。%K%P
I was unable to understand what could have been plaguing\nher mind.%K%P
她的烦恼，我一无所知；她的心愿，我也从未了解。%K%P
...I was powerless to understand her feelings.%K%P
…我渐渐地远离了她的心。%K%P
I didn't know what to do. Everything I did caused her more\nsuffering.%K%P
我变得不知所措，\n只是，一直苦了她的一片真情。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI love her.\d%K%P
「我爱着都子」%K%P
Toko cried in front of me.%K%P
她在我的面前，流下了眼泪。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI love her more than anyone else in the world. And my\nfeelings are in no way inferior to yours, Himeo, or to\nanyone else's.\d%K%P
「在这个世界上，是我最爱的人。\n姫绪小姐也好，别人也好，\n此情此意，我决不会落于他们之后」%K%P
And then, when the pain became too strong for her to\nendure, she finally laid bare all that had resided in her\nchest.%K%P
一直深藏着的，痛苦而心酸的感情，\n终于如洪水一般不可收拾。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's why I can't allow a failed guardian... that is, a\nman like me to have Toko in any shape or form!\d%K%P
「所以我这个监护人，\n是绝不会让我这个男人把都子夺走的！」%K%P
Despite knowing how wrong it was, I couldn't help...\ncoveting those tiny, soft lips of hers.%K%P
我…明明知道是不行的，\n然而对于她那温柔而小巧的嘴唇…却完全抵抗不住。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI won't acknowledge any man that would make her unhappy.\nI can't allow it. I can't allow such a bastard to take\nyou, Toko!!\d%K%P
「我绝不认可让都子不幸的男人！\n我不会原谅…那种人，我绝不会原谅的，都子！」%K%P
...All I succeeded at was making her suffer even more.%K%P
…我让都子越来越痛苦了。%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUh... uahh... uah...\nI-I'm sorry... for shouting... and everything...\d%K%P
「啊…呜呜…呜啊…啊，\n抱、抱歉…突然，嚷了起来…啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWell, Toko's always been a stubborn one.\nOnce she sets her eyes on something, nothing in the world\nwill stop her.\d%K%P
「小都子，真是顽固啊…\n这么一来，可就没有退路了啊…」%K%P
Himeo, who had been castigating me just a few moments ago,\nwas now trying to defend me from myself.%K%P
直到刚才，还和我一样，责怪着我的姬绪小姐，\n不知何时，转变了对我的立场。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBut Osamu... In that case, you'll have to turn her down.\d%K%P
「但是啊，理君…\n若是这样，理君，可就必须得甩了那孩子了哦？」%K%P
Meanwhile, Ms. Kaya touched upon the very issue I tried my\nbest to avoid with a marksman's precision.%K%P
顺理成章的，夏夜小姐…\n把我最不想得出的结论，明确地提了出来。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIt just has to be done.\nAnd you're the only one in any position to do it, Osamu.\d%K%P
「这是谁都不得不做的…\n然而，也是只有你才能做到的事啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...!\d%K%P
「………啊」%K%P
No...%K%P
我不要%K%P
That would make Toko sad. I didn't even want to imagine\nit, but she would likely burst out in tears again.%K%P
若是那么做了，都子肯定会更加悲伤。\n虽然我一厢情愿地不去相信，但她一定会哭的。%K%P
I didn't want to see her sad ever again.\nI wanted to spend the rest of my life basking in her\nsmile.%K%P
我已经，不想再看到她流泪的脸。\n这一生，我只想看到她的笑颜。%K%P
And I wanted her to smile... by my side.%K%P
这一生，我都要她在我的身边，露出笑颜…%K%P
